Prepare TitanOS for production deployment.

Verify:

=E2=9C=93 Production build passes

=E2=9C=93 No console errors

=E2=9C=93 No TypeScript errors

=E2=9C=93 No ESLint errors

=E2=9C=93 No broken links

=E2=9C=93 No broken images

=E2=9C=93 Mobile responsiveness

=E2=9C=93 Performance optimization

=E2=9C=93 Accessibility

=E2=9C=93 Error boundaries

=E2=9C=93 API error handling

=E2=9C=93 Authentication

=E2=9C=93 Security best practices

=E2=9C=93 Loading states

=E2=9C=93 Empty states

=E2=9C=93 Environment variables

=E2=9C=93 Database connections

=E2=9C=93 Rate limiting where appropriate

=E2=9C=93 SEO metadata

=E2=9C=93 Sitemap

=E2=9C=93 Robots.txt

=E2=9C=93 Favicon

=E2=9C=93 Manifest

=E2=9C=93 PWA support if enabled

Generate a deployment report summarizing any remaining issues and
recommendations.

